product status 可读，run 必须先显式迁移，旧未确认执行先兼容旧版恢复。\n"},"guidance":[]},"next":{"source":"local-state","executable":false,"currentRunRef":".mendi/runs/d01/015-delivery-test-attempt/run.md","role":"author","action":"delivery-verification","status":"awaiting-owner-instruction","reason":"按完整计划、直接组来源及必要审核显式继续；选中范围成功不等于完整候选。"}}}
